  {"id":"NAFES-9-130","track":"nafes","level":"Grade 9","topic":"Quadratic Equations","type":"MCQ","difficulty":"hard","content":{"en":{"question":"For what value of \\( k \\) does \\( x^2 + kx + 16 = 0 \\) have equal roots?","options":["\\( k = 4 \\)","\\( k = 8 \\)","\\( k = 16 \\)","\\( k = \\pm 8 \\)"],"hint":"Equal roots when discriminant \\( = 0 \\): \\( k^2 - 4(16) = 0 \\).","explanation":"\\( k^2 = 64 \\Rightarrow k = \\pm 8 \\)."},"ar":{"question":"لأي قيمة لـ\\( k \\) يكون لـ\\( x^2 + kx + 16 = 0 \\) جذران متساويان؟","options":["\\( k = 4 \\)","\\( k = 8 \\)","\\( k = 16 \\)","\\( k = \\pm 8 \\)"],"hint":"جذران متساويان عندما المميّز \\( = 0 \\).","explanation":"\\( k^2 = 64 \\Rightarrow k = \\pm 8 \\)."}},"correct_index":"3"},
