  {"id":"NAFES-9-142","track":"nafes","level":"Grade 9","topic":"Sequences","type":"MCQ","difficulty":"medium","content":{"en":{"question":"Is the sequence \\( 2, 6, 18, 54, \\ldots \\) arithmetic or geometric?","options":["Arithmetic with \\( d=4 \\)","Geometric with \\( r=3 \\)","Arithmetic with \\( d=3 \\)","Neither"],"hint":"Check: does it add a constant (arithmetic) or multiply by a constant (geometric)?","explanation":"Each term is multiplied by 3, so it is geometric with \\( r=3 \\)."},"ar":{"question":"هل المتتالية \\( 2, 6, 18, 54, \\ldots \\) حسابية أم هندسية؟","options":["حسابية بفرق \\( d=4 \\)","هندسية بأساس \\( r=3 \\)","حسابية بفرق \\( d=3 \\)","لا شيء من ذلك"],"hint":"تحقق: هل تُضاف قيمة ثابتة (حسابية) أم تُضرب في ثابت (هندسية)؟","explanation":"كل حد يُضرب في 3، إذن هي هندسية."}},"correct_index":"1"},
  {"id":"NAFES-9-143","track":"nafes","level":"Grade 9","topic":"Geometry","type":"MCQ","difficulty":"hard","content":{"en":{"question":"A chord of length \\( 16 \\) cm is \\( 6 \\) cm from the centre of a circle. What is the radius?","options":["\\( 8 \\) cm","\\( 10 \\) cm","\\( 12 \\) cm","\\( 14 \\) cm"],"hint":"Use: \\( r^2 = 8^2 + 6^2 \\) (half-chord and perpendicular distance).","explanation":"\\( r = \\sqrt{64+36} = \\sqrt{100} = 10 \\) cm."},"ar":{"question":"وتر طوله \\( 16 \\) سم يبعد \\( 6 \\) سم عن مركز الدائرة. ما نصف قطرها؟","options":["\\( 8 \\) سم","\\( 10 \\) سم","\\( 12 \\) سم","\\( 14 \\) سم"],"hint":"استخدم: \\( r^2 = 8^2 + 6^2 \\).","explanation":"\\( r = \\sqrt{100} = 10 \\) سم."}},"correct_index":"1"},
